<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_leqno">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">When Should Users Check? A Decision-Theoretic Model of Confirmation Frequency in Multi-Step AI Agent Tasks</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_doi"><span class="ltx_note_name">DOI: </span><a href="https://doi.org/XXXXXXX.XXXXXXX">XXXXXXX.XXXXXXX</a></span></span></span>
